>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Bacterial food source &#8212; survival through stomach.</td>\n\n                  <tr style=\"\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Chlorides</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Electrolyte balance &#8212; hydration support.</td>\n\n\n\n                </tbody>\n\n\n              </table>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.labReports\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Third-party lab reports</h3>\n\n\n              <p style=\"color: var(--pp-ink-500); font-size: var(--pp-text-sm); margin: 0;\">No specific lab report required. Manufactured under factory-level QC (ISO 22716); full COA available on request.</p>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
